        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86442, Mid-Century Modern Alexander Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Alexander Front Door Handle has a clean design that thrives in its minimalistic approach to home decor. This door pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on a wood, fiberglass, or metal door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. The Mid-Century Modern Alexander Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from several beautiful finishes to complete your bold door remodel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/alexander-back-to-back-door-handle-set-emtek-btb-86442\"><b>Alexander Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Alexander Thru-Bolt Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86442-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Alexander Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86442:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86443:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
